    },
    {
      "id": "S2",
      "finding": "World and Academy hosts retain active temporary tuning configuration across same-session restart/reset/input/mode transitions. World preferences preserve saved FOV/tilt during drafts, host camera save callbacks are gated, and shared flight-comfort saves only when canPersistCamera allows it.",
      "meaning": "Current combined native checks must distinguish retained temporary trials from saved setup/camera preferences. This is localStorage/configuration scope, not IDB evidence."
    },
    {
      "id": "S3",
      "finding": "World close awaits owned flight disposal and rechecks launch/disposed ownership before restoring saved camera settings and clearing active draft state. Academy review explicitly clears active drafts.",
      "meaning": "Normal trial close/reopen and remaining pagehide/ownership transitions need current evidence; no original public storage intervention is justified."
    },
    {
      "id": "S4",
      "finding": "Advanced runtime defaults aircraft and regional backend constants to v2 while accepting explicit v1; supported grounded integral policy changes for v2. The worker accepts legacy aircraft reference backend.",
